 "about": "Think of GIVE as your concierge anti-aging and corrective skin destination for your face and body. A personalized, physician-supervised Medical Aesthetic Studio.\n                   Katrina started her Aesthetic career over 25 years ago in the Pacific Northwest. She developed a true passion for the skin when working in the retail make-up artistry business, Once obtaining her full specialist aesthetic license, along with her focus of education in Chemistry  she then found a balance with science and beauty.\n                  As she moved to SouthWest Florida, she furthered her career and continued her education to extend into Medical Aesthetics. Katrina obtained her Licensure as a Certified Clinical Electrologist, as well as a Certified Medical Electrologist, this also encompassed the studies in Light-Based Energy and Class 4 Laser training. Furthermore, she also continued on her own, the study of numerous lasers at every clinical training available from many different platform device companies and stand alone machines to formulate what is most effective for the advancements of improving skin imperfections and anti-aging choices available today.\n                She has also been trained and certified on other non-invasive modalities such as Micro-Current, Ultrasonic Cavitation, Plasma Pen Fibroblast, LED light Therapy, Intense Pulse Light, Laser Skin Resurfacing,  Dermaplaning, Stem Cell Infusion, Cryotherapy, Oxygen Infusion, Hydrafacial , Microneedling, and Radio Frequency.\n               After working over a decade with some of the best doctors and surgeons in both Lee and Collier County, she has decided to take the next step.  Now,  at GIVE skin care  customized one on one  quality service with her hand selected equipment, flexible scheduling, smart treatment choices advanced skincare products will offer you optimal results.\n              Katrina specializes in acne treatments, scar revision, skin tightening for face or body, medical-grade skin care, photorejuvenation, laser hair removal, cellulite reduction, medical- grade + custom blended peels and Syndeo Hydrafacials. Take this opportunity to schedule a complimentary consultation.  A customized treatment plan for you will be implemented to reach your goals. Or go ahead and book what you love!\n             Come explore all the Unique Aesthetic Experiences offered at GIVE skin care.                     \n                                                                         \n                                                                    Katrina R Deem, MA,FS,LE at GIVEskincareLLC\nDr. Jerilee E Lomas D.O  -  Medical Director\n \n21300 S Branch Blvd Unit 6119\nSuite #209\nEstero Fl 33928",
